  "title": "31st Rescue Squadron Balikatan 2019",
  "description": "Social media video of U.S. Air Force pararescuemen from the the 31st Rescue Squadron located at Kadena Air Base in Okinawa, Japan conducting search and rescue training with members from the Armed Forces of the Philippines during Exercise Balikatan 2019. Exercise Balikatan, in its 35th iteration, is an annual U.S.-Philippine military training focused on a variety of missions, including humanitarian assistance and disaster relief, counter-terrorism, and other combined military operations held from April 1 to April 12.",
